{
//该翻译补丁经检查应该没有任何问题。
  "UIDictionary": {
    "Mod Jam Hub": "模组创作赛枢纽"
  },

  "DialogueDictionary": {
    //BaseGameComputer.xml
    "Orrery Computer": "星象仪终端",
    "Hey there! I'm a computer dedicated to scanning and tracking all of the different mods in this system.": "你好呀！我是一台专门用于追踪创作赛星系中各类模组的终端。",
    "You can use my orrery above us to track the relative positions of different bodies.": "你可以用我们上方的星象仪，追踪各个天体的相对位置。",
    "I can even give you a bit of information on the different mods that are installed, and lock on to the main bodies of each mod!": "我甚至还能为你展示已安装各类模组的信息，还能锁定每个模组的主天体哦！",
    "Page 1": "页面1",
    "Page 2": "页面2",
    "Page 3": "页面3",
    "Page 4": "页面4",
    "Page 5": "页面5",
    "Exit": "退出",
    "Lock on to body. ": "锁定它的主天体",
    "Cancel.": "取消",
    "If you go to a system hosting a mod jam (such as the jam 3 system), I can help you keep track of the mods and the bodies associated with them!": "如果你前往举办模组创作赛的星系（比如第三届创作赛星系、Jam 3 System），我可以帮你追踪这些模组以及与之关联的天体！", //无效
    "Unfortunately, the base-game system doesn't have much for me to do. You can still check out the other landmarks on the planet though!": "可惜的是，在原版游戏的星系里我没什么可做的。不过你依然可以去看看这颗星球上的其他地标！", //无效

    //computer.xml
    "Ernesto": "厄内斯托",
    "So, yeah, this is the last thing on the tour, its some sort of weird computer.": "好啦，这就是游览的最后一站，这东西是台古怪的终端。",
    "I think you can use it to, like, lock onto planets and stuff? Plus there's an orrery, so that's pretty neat.": "我觉得你能用它，锁定行星之类的？而且它还有个星象仪，还挺有意思的。",
    "But yeah, that's the tour, we're done now.": "好啦，游览到此就结束了。",
    "Did you have any questions or anything like that?": "你有什么想问的吗？",
    "Why don't you have collision?": "你怎么没有碰撞体积啊？",
    "Why are you missing a tooth?": "你怎么少了颗牙？",
    "Nope.": "没有。",
    "The modders didn't feel like dealing with me having physics and stuff.": "模组创作者们懒得给我做物理碰撞这些玩意儿。",
    "Cleric's going to claim that it's cosplay, but he actually just mixed up some models in his files.": "Cleric会说这是角色扮演，但其实他就是在文件里弄混模型了。",

    //equator.xml
    "Cool, you made it.": "不错嘛，你赶到了。",
    "So, this is a showcase of some of the popular mods that have been made for Outer Wilds, if you want to read about them. It includes story mods on one exhibit, and more general mods on the other.": "这是《星际拓荒》热门模组的展示区，想了解的话可以看看。一边展示的是故事类模组，另一边是通用类模组。",
    "There's also four other showcases. They show upcoming mods, abandoned mods, utility mods, and jam entries.": "还有另外四个展示区，分别展示未上线模组、废弃模组、实用模组和创作赛参赛作品。",
    "They're all on the equator, so I'm not gonna bother showing you them. Instead I'm gonna show you the thingamajig at the south pole, so meet me there.": "都在赤道上，我就不费劲儿带你一个个看了。不如我带你去南极看个好玩儿的玩意儿，到那儿见。",

    //shack.xml
    "Oh, uh, hey, it's me, Ernesto the magic talking anglerfish.": "哦，呃，嘿，是我，会说话的魔法安康鱼厄内斯托。",
    "I guess I'm supposed to give you a tour of the planet or something, so, yeah, let's do that.": "我好像得带你逛逛这颗星球之类的，那咱们就出发吧。",
    "So, first off, this is the party shack, there's a bunch of modders inside that you can chat with if you want. It's pretty neat.": "首先，这是派对小屋，里面有好多模组创作者，想聊天的话可以进去。还挺有意思的。",
    "...Yeah, that's pretty much all there is to that, so I'm gonna say we should move on. Follow me, or don't, but I'm going to the equator.": "……嗯，这儿差不多就这样了，咱们继续往前走吧。跟不跟来随你，反正我要去赤道了。",

    //Can't Afford a Name.xml
    "Can't Afford a Name": "Can't Afford a Name",
    "Oh, hey! Pleasure to meet you, I'm Can't Afford a Name.": "哦，嘿！很高兴认识你，我是Can't Afford a Name。",
    "I was invited because of my involvement in Archipelago and Tesseract's Secret.": "我因为参与了《Archipelago》和《Tesseract's Secret》模组的制作才受邀来的。",
    "Did you know that there's an unofficial Outer Wilds modding discord? I go by \"Can't Afford a Name\" over there.": "你知道有个非官方的《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord社群吗？我在那儿的ID也是“Can't Afford a Name”。",
    "You should also check out my YouTube channel, I make a lot of fun videos over there.": "你也可以去看看我的YouTube频道，我在上面发了好多有意思的视频。",

    //2walker2.xml
    "2walker2": "2walker2",
    "Hello, I'm Walker! I was the lead developer of Astral Codec. I've also worked on the mod jam entries Evacuation, Reflections, Root Access, and Heliostudy.": "你好，我是Walker！我是《Astral Codec》的首席开发者。我还参与过创作赛参赛作品《Evacuation》《Reflections》《Root Access》和《Heliostudy》的制作。",
    "Astral Codec is one of the biggest projects I've ever worked on and it would never have been finished without the help of many other people, several of whom are attending this very party! I'm really proud to be a part of this community.": "《Astral Codec》是我参与过的最大型的项目之一，没有其他很多人的帮助根本完不成——其中好几个人现在就在这个派对里！能成为这个社群的一份子，我真的很自豪。",
    "If you're reading this and thinking about making a mod yourself, go for it! If you're unsure how to start, ask on the Discord. Or find a team and try making something for the next jam. You never know what you could make.": "如果你看到这段话，也想自己做模组，那就放手去做吧！不知道怎么开始的话，就去Discord上问问。或者找个团队，试着为下一届创作赛做个作品。你永远不知道自己能做出什么。",
    "If you're playing this in the Jam 3 system, my team's entry (Reflections) can be found on Forlorn Project out by the edge of the solar system. Try to avoid being sealed away forever.": "如果你在第三届创作赛星系里玩这个模组，我团队的作品《Reflections》在太阳系边缘的“被遗弃的项目”星球上能找到。尽量别被永远封印起来哦。",
    "If you're playing this in Jam 5, my team's entry (Heliostudy) is the solar system with the holographic purple lines. You should check out the developer commentary (enabled in the options) after playing it!": "如果你在第五届创作赛星系里玩，我团队的作品《Heliostudy》是那个有全息紫色线的太阳系。通关后一定要听听开发者解说（可以在设置里开启）！",
    "If you want to chat, feel free to ping me (@2walker2) on the modding Discord! I'm happy to help new modders or to answer questions about any of the mods I worked on.": "想聊天的话，随时可以在模组创作Discord上@我（@2walker2）！我很乐意帮助新模组创作者，或者解答关于我参与制作的任何模组的问题。",

    //AmazingAlek.xml
    "AmazingAlek": "AmazingAlek",
    "Oh, hey! I don't know if we've met, my name is AmazingAlek!": "哦，嘿！不知道我们见过没，我是AmazingAlek！",
    "I'm glad to see Quantum Space Buddies and OWML getting some more recognition, makes me proud!": "看到《Quantum Space Buddies》和OWML得到更多认可，我真的很开心！",
    "I go by \"alek\" on the Outer Wilds modding discord, feel free to stop by and chat!": "我在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上的ID是“alek”，欢迎过来聊聊！",

    //anonymous.xml
    "Anonymous": "Anonymous",
    "stop right there! don't make another step!": "站住！不准再往前走了！",
    "i'm amazed, you've earned my respect. you kept the light off. see, i really don't like the light!": "真没想到，你赢得了我的尊重。你没开灯。知道吗，我特别讨厌光！",
    "just you know, if you turn that thing on i will kill you.": "跟你说，你要是敢开灯，我就杀了你。",
    "alright then, what do you want from me?": "好吧，你想从我这儿得到什么？",
    "Who are you?": "你是谁？",
    "do you wish to know anything else?": "你还想知道别的吗？",
    "Where are we?": "我们在哪儿？",
    "Why aren't you with the rest?": "你为什么不和其他人待在一起？",
    "Tell me more about your work.": "多说说你的作品。",
    "What story mods do you recommend?": "你推荐哪些故事类模组？",
    "What got you into Outer Wilds?": "是什么让你喜欢上《星际拓荒》的？",
    "Why are you so anonymous?": "你为什么这么神秘？",
    "Why did you leave the Discord?": "你为什么退出Discord了？",
    "Goodbye.": "再见。",
    "who am i?": "我是谁？",
    "i'm the fellow who made the stranger they are.": "我就是制作《The Stranger They Are》的人。",
    "that's right, i am anonymous.": "没错，我就是Anonymous。",
    "but don't be fooled, this is not my form. this mere thing is a vessel in which i control to communicate to you.": "但别被骗了，这不是我的真实形态。这玩意儿只是我用来和你交流的载体。",
    "i just told you who i was!": "我刚告诉你我是谁了！",
    "you're wondering where we are?": "你想知道我们在哪儿？",
    "we're in the catacombs of this planet, far below the ground.": "我们在这颗星球的地下墓穴里，在离地面很深的地方。",
    "i built this place by bringing these pieces to unity.": "这地方是我把这些碎片拼凑起来建成的。",
    "that's because it's so goddamn bright out there. i hate light.": "因为外面太亮了，真该死。我讨厌光。",
    "don't get me wrong, i think all the other modders are great people to talk to, and i love the community.": "别误会，我觉得其他模组创作者都很容易相处，我也很爱这个社群。",
    "*sigh* i wish i could have the chance to run into some of them in real life. that would change everything.": "*叹气* 真希望能有机会在现实中见到他们中的一些人。那样一切都会不一样了。",
    "my work? yes, i've made the stranger they are and helped develop the cosmic curators.": "我的作品？没错，我做了《The Stranger They Are》，还参与开发了《The Cosmic Curators》。",
    "tsta is something i feel mixed about, because it's given me such frusturation during development, yet some other things i'm proud of.": "我对《The Stranger They Are》的感情很复杂，在开发过程中我遇到了很多挫折，但也有一些地方让我很自豪。",
    "honestly, i shit on my own mods for shits and giggles. i know i've made a great mod, i'm proud of it, but i don't want to be that person who just annoyingly promotes their mod.": "说实话，我有时候会吐槽自己的模组，纯粹是为了好玩。我知道自己做的模组很棒，也很自豪，但我不想做那种没完没了推销自己模组的人。",
    "curators on the other hand went completely smoothly, and it's mostly because i've learned from my mistakes in the stranger they are. i designed most of the puzzles for that mod.": "而《The Cosmic Curators》的开发就顺利多了，主要是因为我从《The Stranger They Are》的错误中吸取了教训。那个模组的大部分谜题都是我设计的。",
    "what were those mistakes?": "那些错误是什么？",
    "1. don't edit too much things in base game, or things will break. (tsta did that a lot!)": "1. 别过多修改原版游戏内容，不然会出问题。（《The Stranger They Are》就犯了很多这种错！）",
    "2. don't mess with quantum stuff too much. (it's what caused clay to stop modding and some bugs that still remain in tsta)": "2. 别过多摆弄量子相关的内容。（这也是导致Clay停止做模组的原因，而且《The Stranger They Are》里还有些bug没修复。）",
    "i hope that people can learn from my mistakes and avoid them when modding. it's these two things that caused tsta to have so many bugs and spend another several months in bug fixing hell.": "希望大家能从我的错误中吸取教训，做模组的时候避开这些坑。就是这两点，让《The Stranger They Are》出了这么多bug，还多花了好几个月时间修复。",
    "i'm glad to ask!": "我很乐意推荐！",
    "first, let me get the elephant out of the room. forgotten castaways.": "首先，先说说最热门的——《Forgotten Castaways》。",
    "no, cleric is not paying me to say this! i love that mod so much!": "不，Cleric没给钱让我吹这个！我是真的超爱这个模组！",
    "i've always found dark bramble fun, even with the anglerfish! so i immediately fell in love with this mod when i playtested it for cleric.": "我一直觉得黑棘星挺有意思的，就算有安康鱼也不怕！所以我帮Cleric测试这个模组的时候，一下子就爱上它了。",
    "i also highly recommend the outsider, which used to be my favorite before castaways. it too was dark bramble related, but has a nice little mix of dlc in it. (i also love the dlc)": "我还强烈推荐《The Outsider》，在《Forgotten Castaways》之前，这是我最喜欢的模组。它也和黑棘星有关，但还融入了一些DLC的元素，挺不错的。（我也超爱那个DLC）",
    "there's also a lot more i recommend. the hearth's neighbor series, band together, dreambound, evacuation, hearth1an's mods, root access, unnamed mystery, heliostudy, project arc, mindscapes...": "还有好多我想推荐的。《Hearth's Neighbor》系列、《Band Together》、《Dreambound》、《Evacuation》、hearth1an做的模组、《Root Access》、《Unnamed Mystery》、《Heliostudy》、《Project ARC》、《Mindscapes》……",
    "...fret's quest, quasar project, finis, symbiosis, tesseract's secret, astral codec, lonesome lake, on a rail!, under a radio moon, core collapse, and the box! especially the box!": "……《Fret's Quest》、《The Quasar Project》、《Finis》、《Symbiosis》、《Tesseract's Secret》、《Astral Codec》、《Lonesome Lake》、《On A Rail!》、《Under a Radio Moon》、《Core Collapse》，还有《The Box》！尤其是《The Box》！",
    "oh! and i playtested for eyes of the past, easily one of my top 3 mods. keep an eye for that one when it comes out!": "哦对！我还帮《Eyes of the Past》做过测试，这绝对是我心中前三的模组。等它发布了一定要关注！",
    "also uh, you can check out my mods too i guess, if you want. i don't like boasting about it too much.": "对了，如果你愿意的话，也可以看看我的模组。我不太喜欢过多吹嘘自己的作品。",
    "...wait, do i hear snoring? do i have to say all that again? too bad, i'm not!": "……等等，我好像听到打鼾声了？我还得再说一遍吗？才不要！",
    "you know that one nintendo direct that went \"you have 22 minutes until the solar system is destroyed\"?": "你记得有个任天堂发布会里说“距离太阳系毁灭还有22分钟”吗？",
    "yeah. that one.": "对，就是那个。",
    "i didn't buy it until later that year and i neglected it for a while, and finally beat it at the very beginning of 2023.": "我直到那年晚些时候才买，之后搁置了一阵子，2023年初才通关。",
    "by the way, my first planet i visited was dark bramble! i thought it was cool so i went in it and landed on top of the red seed thinking it was a place to land...then i died to an anglerfish lol.": "对了，我第一个去的星球就是黑棘星！我觉得它很酷，就飞进去了，还把红色种子当成着陆点降了上去……结果被安康鱼吃了，哈哈。",
    "when i did finish outer wilds, i bought the dlc a few months later. it took me less than a month to beat the dlc, and not long after i started installing mods.": "通关《星际拓荒》后，我几个月后就买了DLC。通关DLC只花了我不到一个月，之后没多久我就开始装模组了。",
    "my first mod was the vision, then i played the outsider. i enjoyed both, and then i kept playing mods until i decided one day to mess around with new horizons.": "我玩的第一个模组是《The Vision》，然后是《The Outsider》。这两个我都很喜欢，之后我就一直玩各种模组，直到有一天决定试试《New Horizons》。",
    "i messed with mods in my spare time, and even had a prototype for tsta, until i realized the inhabitant kit wiki became public, which made me want to join the server and get access.": "我业余时间就捣鼓模组，甚至还做了《The Stranger They Are》的原型，后来发现鹿人工具包的Wiki公开了，就想加入服务器获取权限。",
    "then, i wanted to bring my idea to life. i've had tsta as an idea since early november of 2023, and then it finally released about 1 and a half years later.": "然后我就想把自己的想法变成现实。《The Stranger They Are》这个想法是2023年11月初有的，大概一年半后才正式发布。",
    "i left the server for a bit, and came back because i wanted to participate in jam 5, and i ended up working with pik and stache to make cosmic curators as the main programmer.": "我退出服务器一段时间后又回来了，因为想参加第五届创作赛，最后和Pik、Stache合作，作为主程序员制作了《The Cosmic Curators》。",
    "at the end, i helped cleric breathe new life into the mod jam mod, and then...i left for good.": "最后，我帮Cleric给这个创作赛模组注入了新内容，然后……就彻底退出了。",
    "can't share that too much because i want to be anonymous.": "因为想保持神秘，我不能说太多。",
    "the internet is a dangerous place, and i've had some bad interactions in the past. when i wanted to join the modding community, i wanted to anonymize myself due to those past experiences.": "互联网挺危险的，我以前有过一些不好的互动经历。所以加入模组创作社群的时候，就想保持匿名。",
    "every public sector of the web has that drama and toxcicity that breaks out...but not the outer wilds modding community. it's impressive how lacking of these things the server is.": "网上所有公共社群都难免会有矛盾和戾气……但《星际拓荒》的模组创作社群没有。这个服务器里几乎没有这些乱七八糟的事，真的很难得。",
    "modding has proven to be a consuming part of my life, and i want to fully retire. because i have a lot of drive, i would spend all my free time modding. so what good is being in the modding server if you're not modding?": "事实证明，做模组已经占据了我生活的太多时间，我想彻底停一停了。我曾经很投入，一有空就会去做模组。所以如果不做模组了，留在模组服务器里还有什么意义呢？",
    "and even if neither if those were true, there's something about leaving that....sort of gives me peace. i can't really describe it.": "就算不是因为这些，离开这件事本身……也能让我心里平静下来。我说不清楚。",
    "i don't hate anybody. it's honestly more of a lifestyle choice. i'm doing this for the betterment for myself.": "我不恨任何人。这其实更像是一种生活选择。我是为了让自己变得更好。",
    "i won't forget the great times i had in the server. thank you, outer wilds community.": "我不会忘记在服务器里度过的美好时光。谢谢你们，《星际拓荒》社群。",
    "farewell.": "再见。",

    //Artum.xml
    "Artum": "Artum",
    "Hey there! I'm Artum.": "嘿！我是Artum。",
    "I was invited because of my involvement in NomaiVR.": "我因为参与了《NomaiVR》的制作才受邀来的。",
    "You can find me on the Outer Wilds modding discord as \"artum\"!": "你可以在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上找到我，ID是“artum”！",

    //Bird.xml
    "Bird": "Bird",
    "Hey there! I'm Bird.": "嘿！我是Bird。",
    "Extinction is a mod I started working on a few years ago. I got about halfway through it, but I eventually stopped because I had lost a lot of ambition and was moving on to other things.": "《Extinction》是我几年前开始做的一个模组。做到一半左右就停了，因为没那么有动力了，而且也开始忙别的事了。",
    "Most of what was left involved coding and writing, implementing puzzles and text, connecting everything, finishing a few structures, and playtesting.": "剩下的大部分工作都是编程、写文案、实现谜题和文本、把所有内容串联起来、完成一些建筑，还有测试。",
    "Some ideas from Extinction ended up inspiring my Jam 3 mod, Symbiosis, so go check that out.": "《Extinction》里的一些想法后来启发了我在第三届创作赛中的作品《Symbiosis》，可以去看看。",
    "You can find me on the Outer Wilds modding discord as \"Bird\"!": "你可以在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上找到我，ID是“Bird”！",
    "Why is that guy locked in a cage?": "那个人为什么被关在笼子里？",
    "Oh, yeah, he was causing trouble so I put him in there. Don't worry about it.": "哦，因为他捣乱，所以我就把他关进去了。别担心。",

    //Book.xml
    "Book": "Book",
    "Hey! Welcome to the party! I'm Book, nice to meet you!": "嘿！欢迎来派对！我是Book，很高兴认识你！",
    "I'm here because of my work on New Horizons.": "我是因为参与了《New Horizons》的制作才来的。",
    "You can find me on the Outer Wilds modding discord as \"Book\"!": "你可以在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上找到我，ID是“Book”！",

    //Hearth1an.xml
    "Hearth1an": "Hearth1an",
    "Yo, how's it going? My name is Hearth1an.": "哟，最近咋样？我是Hearth1an。",
    "Have you played The Vision? I was actually involved in it, you should give it a try!": "你玩过《The Vision》吗？我参与了这个模组的制作，真的可以试试！",
    "You can find me on the Outer Wilds modding discord as \"hearth1an\"!": "你可以在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上找到我，ID是“hearth1an”！",

    //Clay.xml
    "Clay": "Clay",
    "Oh, hey! I don't know if we've met, my name is Clay!": "哦，嘿！不知道我们见过没，我是Clay！",
    "Did you know that I'm also working on Uncertain Futures? I'm looking forward to getting to release it once it's done!": "你知道我还在做《Uncertain Futures》吗？等做完了就发布，我还挺期待的！",
    "Did you know that there's an unofficial Outer Wilds modding discord? I go by \"clay\" over there.": "你知道有个非官方的《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord社群吗？我在那儿的ID是“clay”。",

    //cOaRemote.xml
    "cOa Rex": "cOa Rex",
    "Oh yeah, Anon? They really don't like the light, you know.": "哦对了，Anonymous？你知道吗，他真的很讨厌光。",
    "You have to walk up to them without any lights on, or else they will just keep kicking you out, like, again and again.": "你得关灯走近他，不然他会一直把你赶出去，一次又一次。",
    "Once you done it the first time, it's too late, my friend.": "一旦你第一次开着灯靠近，就晚了，朋友。",
    "You might have to restart to be able to talk to them again. It can be a bit annoying, but that is how it is!": "你可能得重来才能再和他说话。有点麻烦，但没办法！",

    //cOaRex.xml
    "Hey Traveler! They called me Rex, or cOa.": "嘿，旅行者！他们叫我Rex，或者cOa。",
    "I'm the drawer who worked on some mods like Cosmics Curators or Eyes of the Past.": "我是个画师，参与过《The Cosmic Curators》和《Eyes of the Past》等模组的制作。",
    "I'm also working on an animation like the DLC slide reels named A Stranger I Remain. It's also where come from the character \"the Stranger\".": "我还在做一个动画，就像DLC里的幻灯片那样，名字叫《A Stranger I Remain》。“陌生人”这个角色也出自这里。", //句意不明
    "You know, sometimes, you have dreams or projects, like, big dreams. And more little dreams. But doesn't make them less important.": "你知道吗，有时候你会有梦想或者计划，有大梦想，也有很多小梦想。但小梦想也同样重要。",
    "One of mine was to do a mod and be on the team of Anon, pikpik, Stache, and Repcon. Well, my team actually.": "我的一个梦想就是做一个模组并加入Anonymous、pikpik、Stache和Repcon的团队。好吧，其实现在就是我的团队了。",
    "Live simple life can also means to enjoy every little dreams like this that coming true. And I have made a souvenir of our team. Maybe you will find it. It's pretty easy.": "简单生活也意味着享受每一个这样实现的小梦想。我还做了一个我们团队的纪念品，你可能会找到它，挺容易的。",
    "You can find me on Discord by cOa Rex, on in Youtube by centre Ombre alpha. This is where I will upload A Stranger I Remain... When it will be ready.": "你可以在Discord上通过搜cOa Rex找到我，YouTube上的频道是centre Ombre alpha。等《A Stranger I Remain》做好了，我会传到上面。",
    "Feel free to come talk, or if your need 2D Arts for a mod or for something, maybe I could help, even if I take time for everything.": "欢迎来找我聊天，如果你做模组或者别的东西需要2D美术，我也许能帮忙，虽然我做什么都比较慢。",
    "Also, be sure to explore mods. The Stranger They Are, Forgotten Castaways, etc, etc. This is because people make mod, and people playing it, make feedback, and share that Outer Wilds continue to live.": "另外，一定要多试试各种模组。《The Stranger They Are》《Forgotten Castaways》之类的。因为有人做模组，有人玩，有人提反馈，分享，《星际拓荒》才能一直“活着”。",
    "So, see you in Eyes of the Past, The Cosmic Curators, The Stranger They Are, and A Stranger I Remain.": "那么，在《Eyes of the Past》《The Cosmic Curators》《The Stranger They Are》和《A Stranger I Remain》里见啦。",
    "And maybe... in another story mod ? Yeah, that is my little secret for now, but I have a idea for it, even if it takes years, I hope you will still be there.": "也许……还会在另一个故事模组里？嗯，这是我现在的小秘密，但我已经有想法了，就算要做好几年。希望到时候你还在。",
    "Before that, I have a lot of things to learn, and to do. Because my imagination never stop!": "在那之前，我还有很多东西要学，很多事要做。因为我的想象力永远不会停！",
    "Have a nice exploration!": "祝你探索愉快！",
    "What was that about Anon, again?": "刚才说Anonymous什么来着？",

    //coderCleric.xml
    "coderCleric": "coderCleric",
    "Hey there! I'm coderCleric, the original creator of the jam hub mod.": "嘿！我是coderCleric，这个创作赛枢纽模组的原创作者。",
    "I hope you've been having fun looking around this little planet and talking to all of the other modders! Anon and I made sure it was a pretty good showcase of what the community has to offer.": "希望你在这颗迷你行星上逛得开心，和其他模组创作者聊得愉快！我和Anonymous确保了这里能很好地展示这个社群的成果。",
    "Howdy again!": "又见面啦！",
    "Was there anything you wanted to chat about?": "有什么想聊的吗？",
    "What future plans do you have?": "你未来有什么计划？",
    "Have any mod recommendations?": "有推荐的模组吗？",
    "So I finished Castaways...": "我通关《Forgotten Castaways》了……",
    "What gave you the idea for the jam hub?": "是什么让你想到做这个创作赛枢纽的？",
    "What other mods have you made?": "你还做过其他什么模组？",
    "Why is Ernesto missing a tooth?": "厄内斯托为什么少了颗牙？",
    "Nothing for now.": "现在没有。",
    "Good question! Right now my priority is getting a job, which is proving to be easier said than done.": "好问题！现在我的首要任务是找工作，这事儿说起来容易做起来难。",
    "Ideally I want to break into game development. I've actually got a little metroidvania that I'm working on in my free time, so we'll see how that turns out!": "理想情况下，我想进入游戏开发行业。我其实在业余时间做了一个小型银河恶魔城游戏，看看最后能做成什么样吧！",
    "In terms of Outer Wilds modding, I'm honestly not super sure how much more I'm planning on doing. I've got one or two ideas that I might develop on, but I'm planning on putting modding on the backburner for a while.": "至于《星际拓荒》的模组制作，说实话我还不确定接下来要做多少。我有一两个想法可能会继续发展，但打算先把模组制作放一放。",
    "I definitely plan on participating in future jams though, they're always a good time. Jam 5 was the first time I got to work with a team and it was a ton of fun!": "不过我肯定会参加未来的创作赛，每次都很开心。第五届创作赛是我第一次和团队合作，真的超好玩！",
    "Oh for sure, let me think for a second...": "当然有，让我想想……",
    "If you're looking for mods that you can chew on for a bit, there's definitely a good supply of those. Astral Codec, The Outsider, and The Stranger They Are are all solid choices.": "如果你想找一些能慢慢玩的模组，可选的真不少。《Astral Codec》《The Outsider》和《The Stranger They Are》都是很不错的选择。",
    "If you'll allow me to plug my own stuff for a moment, I made a fairly large mod called Forgotten Castaways that I'm pretty proud of.": "如果允许我稍微推销一下自己的作品，我做了一个相当大的模组叫《Forgotten Castaways》，我挺自豪的。",
    "The mods from all of the jams are also worth playing, especially the winners. They tend to be a bit shorter too, so you can usually finish them in one play session.": "所有创作赛的模组也都值得玩，尤其是获奖作品。它们通常也短一些，一般一次就能通关。",
    "You should also keep an eye out on the discord for upcoming mods, I know some really good ones are in the works.": "你也可以在Discord上关注即将发布的模组，我知道有一些超棒的模组正在制作中。",
    "Nice! What did you think?": "不错嘛！你觉得怎么样？",
    "It was fun!": "挺好玩的！",
    "Not the biggest fan tbh...": "说实话，不是很喜欢……",
    "It had a lot of writing.": "文字太多了。",
    "How could you kill them all you bastard!": "你怎么能把他们都杀了，你这个混蛋！",
    "Glad to hear it! I'm pretty proud of how it turned out, so it's good to hear that people are enjoying it!": "真高兴你喜欢！我对这个模组的成品挺满意的，所以听到大家喜欢真的很开心！",
    "Heh, fair enough. I'm personally pretty proud of how it turned out, but hey, nothing's gonna be everyone's cup of tea.": "呵，也能理解。我个人对成品挺满意的，但没办法，没有什么能让所有人都喜欢。",
    "Lol, yeah, some of the areas of the mod are definitely a bit dense in terms of text.": "哈哈，是啊，模组里有些地方的文字确实有点多。",
    "Graviton's Folly is probably the biggest offender. If I were to do it all again I'd probably try and disperse some of the text there to other locations.": "“引力愚行”可能是文字最多的地方。如果再做一次，我可能会把那里的一些文字分散到其他地方。",
    "I hope the writing was enjoyable though!": "不过希望那些文字内容还挺有意思的！",
    "Heh, you're not the first person I've heard that from!": "呵，你不是第一个这么说的人！",
    "In all seriousness though, I knew very early on in development that the Dree and Nomai were all going to die at the end of the story. It's how every other story in the game ends, after all.": "不过说真的，我在开发初期就知道德瑞人和挪麦人最后都会死。毕竟，游戏里其他所有的故事都是这样结尾的。",
    "One thing I really tried to emphasize was that they all had really good lives before the DNP went haywire. Since Outer Wilds is all about living life before it's over, it seemed like an important point to make.": "我真正想强调的是，在DNP（德瑞-挪麦项目）失控之前，他们都过着很美好的生活。既然《星际拓荒》的核心就是“在一切结束前好好生活”，我觉得这一点很重要。",
    "While I didn't actually implement it until jam 3, it was actually an idea I had for a while. The “community” theme of that jam was just the perfect excuse to implement it.": "虽然我直到第三届创作赛才真正实现这个想法，但其实我早就有这个念头了。那一届创作赛的“社群”主题正好给了我实现它的绝佳理由。",
    "I just thought that it would be cool to have a mod that introduces the player to the community, as a fun way to help people get to know its members.": "我觉得做一个能让玩家了解这个社群的模组会很酷，用一种有趣的方式让大家认识社群里的人。",
    "I might have stolen the idea from someone else tbh, I'm not sure if I'm the one that came up with the concept. Nonetheless, I'm happy with how it turned out and hope that you're having a good time!": "说实话，这个想法可能是我从别人那儿借鉴的，我不确定是不是我原创的。不过不管怎样，我对成品很满意，希望你玩得开心！",
    "Quite a few, although not nearly as many as some of the other modders in the community.": "挺多的，不过比社群里其他一些模组创作者要少得多。",
    "I've participated in almost every mod jam that the community's hosted, only missing the fourth one.": "社群举办的每一届创作赛我几乎都参加了，只错过了第四届。",
    "My only non-jam story mod is Forgotten Castaways. I'm pretty proud of it and would definitely encourage you to give it a shot.": "我唯一非创作赛的故事模组就是《Forgotten Castaways》。我挺自豪的，非常推荐你试试。",
    "I've also got a number of purely mechanical mods. If you're looking to make the game much, <![CDATA[<i>much</i>]]> worse to play, consider downloading Ghost Everything and Wacky Rotations.": "我还做了一些纯机制类模组。如果你想让游戏变得……超级难玩，可以试试《Ghost Everything》和《Wacky Rotations》。",
    "You can actually search for an author on the mod website, so feel free to use that if you're looking for all mods from a particular person.": "模组网站上其实可以按作者搜索，如果你想找某个人的所有模组，不妨试试。",
    "Not sure to be honest. I think he said that it's cosplay or something?": "说实话我也不确定。我记得他说那是角色扮演之类的？",
    "Sounds good!": "好嘞！",
    "By the way, I go by coderCleric on the OW modding discord (who would've guessed!). Feel free to shoot me a message sometime if you want to give feedback on the hub, or even just to chat!": "对了，我在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上的ID是coderCleric（谁能想到呢！）。如果你想给这个枢纽模组提反馈或者只是想聊天，随时可以给我发消息！",

    //Ditzy.xml
    "ditzy": "ditzy",
    "...": "……",
    "Hello?": "有人吗？",
    "What are you?": "你是什么东西？",
    "I'm sorry! I was just kidding!": "对不起！我只是在开玩笑！",
    "Really, I promise I won't go through you.": "真的，我保证不会穿过你。",
    "Uh...nevermind.": "呃……当我没说。",
    "please leave me alone.": "请别打扰我。",
    "ok. now please leave.": "好。现在请离开。",
    "hi.": "嗨。",
    "You can talk?": "你会说话？",
    "yes?": "是啊？",
    "Oh, sorry, I just didn't expect a...blackhole?...to be able to talk.": "呃，抱歉，我只是没有想到一个…黑洞？…可以说话。",
    "How are you talking?": "你怎么会说话？",
    "yeah, i've heard that plenty of times.": "是啊，我听这话听多了。",
    "How can you talk?": "你怎么会说话？",
    "i mean, how can <![CDATA[<i>you</i>]]> talk?": "我是说，<![CDATA[<i>你</i>]]>怎么会说话？",
    "i was just born this way.": "我生来就这样。",
    "Oh I see. I guess that makes sense.": "哦，原来是这样。好像也说得通。",
    "how are <![CDATA[<i>you</i>]]> talking?": "<![CDATA[<i>你</i>]]>怎么会说话？",
    "Fair point.": "有道理。",
    "It's just something Hearthians can do.": "这是哈斯人天生就会的。",
    "well it's just something <![CDATA[<i>i</i>]]> can do": "这是<![CDATA[<i>我</i>]]>天生就会的",
    "Okay, okay.": "好好好。",
    "ugh. i'm a person, you know.": "呃。我也是个人，你知道的。",
    "I beg to differ. You're clearly a blackhole.": "我不敢苟同。你明明就是个黑洞。",
    "Oh sorry. But you're a blackhole?": "哦，对不起。但你真的是黑洞？",
    "ok. beg.": "好啊。那你求我。",
    "Huh?": "哈？",
    "Uh, no thanks.": "呃，不用了，谢谢。",
    "you said you beg to differ.": "你说你不敢苟同。",
    "so beg.": "那你求我啊。",
    "What? That's not...": "什么？不是这么……",
    "yep.": "就是这么回事。",
    "certainly not a common sight, a talking blackhole.": "会说话的黑洞，确实少见。",
    "but i can hardly control my own birth, right?": "但我也控制不了自己的出身，对吧？",
    "And you helped with Eyes of the Past?": "你参与了《Eyes of the Past》的制作？",
    "i did! although only a little bit, for such a big mod.": "是啊！不过那个模组那么大，我只帮了点小忙。",
    "i also contributed to some jam entries: band together, lumina terra, and under a radio moon.": "我还参与了一些创作赛作品：《Band Together》《Lumina Terra》和《Under a Radio Moon》。",
    "would you like to hear about any of them?": "你想听听其中任何一个吗？",
    "No, I'm good.": "不用了，谢谢。",
    "Eyes of the Past.": "《Eyes of the Past》。",
    "Band Together.": "《Band Together》。",
    "Lumina Terra.": "《Lumina Terra》。",
    "Under a Radio Moon.": "《Under a Radio Moon》。",
    "would you like to hear about any others?": "你还想听听别的吗？",
    "eyes of the past is the first mod i ever helped with.": "《Eyes of the Past》是我第一次帮忙做的模组。",
    "i haven't done too much for it, but i'm very glad for it getting me into modding!": "我没做太多工作，但我很庆幸它让我进入了模组创作这个领域！",
    "you should ask pikpik more about it, though, as it's really his big vision.": "不过你应该多问问pikpik，因为这其实是他的大构想。",
    "band together was my first game jam ever!": "《Band Together》是我第一次参与的游戏创作赛项目！",
    "it was a really ambitious mod, thanks largely to pikpik, hehe.": "那个模组的野心挺大的，主要多亏了pikpik，嘿嘿。",
    "it's also where i met etherpod, who i worked on other mods with afterward!": "我也是在那儿认识了etherpod，后来还和他一起做了其他模组！",
    "lumina terra was a really challenging jam, because of the \"no text\" restriction.": "《Lumina Terra》那次创作赛真的很有挑战性，因为有“无文字”的限制。",
    "i worked on it with etherpod, and while we never got to bring the full idea into being, i really love what we came up with!": "我和etherpod一起做的，虽然没能把完整的想法实现，但我真的很喜欢我们做出的成果！",
    "under a radio moon is the latest jam entry i worked on!": "《Under a Radio Moon》是我最近参与的创作赛作品！",
    "this one was really wild for us, and my first bigger team (me, etherpod, harper, and ernest).": "这次对我们来说真的很疯狂，而且是我第一次加入比较大的团队（我、etherpod、harper和ernest）。",
    "we really tried to push some of our skills with this entry, and that made the process a lot of fun!": "我们真的试着在这个作品中挑战自己的技能极限，这让整个过程变得超有趣！",
    "i'm ditzy, a programmer.": "我是ditzy，一个程序员。",
    "And you're a blackhole?": "而你是个黑洞？",
    "anyway, please don't try to enter me. i'm not just an object to be used.": "不管怎样，请别试着进入我。我不只是一个可以被利用的东西。",
    "I don't know. You <![CDATA[<i>are</i>]]> a blackhole. It's kind of what you're meant for.": "我不知道。你<![CDATA[<i>本来</i>]]>就是个黑洞。这似乎就是你的用途。",
    "Where do you lead to?": "你通向哪里？",
    "Oh, okay. I can respect that.": "哦，好吧。我尊重你的想法。",
    "okay. well just do me a favor and please don't try to enter me. i'm not just an object to be used.": "好。那就帮我个忙，别试着进入我。我不只是一个可以被利用的东西。",
    "no clue. somewhere in this room.": "不知道。就在这个房间的某个地方。",
    "i don't control the exit, i can just sense where it is and it's nearby.": "我控制不了出口，只能感觉到它在附近。",
    "so you gain nothing from going through me but you inconvenience me quite a lot.": "所以你穿过我也得不到任何好处，只会给我带来很大麻烦。",
    "Oh, okay.": "哦，好吧。",
    "thank you.": "谢谢。",
    "Do you mind me asking where you lead to?": "我能问问你通向哪里吗？",
    "Just curious, but what <![CDATA[<i>does</i>]]> happen if someone enters you?": "只是好奇，如果有人进入你会怎么样？",
    "it's somewhere in this room, but i don't know where.": "就在这个房间的某个地方，但我不知道具体在哪里。",
    "i don't control it, i can just roughly sense where the exit is.": "我控制不了它，只能大致感觉到出口的位置。",
    "Ah. So what does happen if someone enters you?": "啊。那如果有人进入你会怎么样？",
    "they exit from some whitehole like normal.": "他们会像平常一样从某个白洞出来。",
    "it's just a very unpleasant sensation to me. so i would appreciate for people to not do it.": "但这对我来说是一种非常不舒服的感觉。所以我希望大家不要这么做。",
    "you should go chat with some of the other mod contributors.": "你应该去和其他模组创作者聊聊。",

    //Endgame Zero.xml
    "EndgameZero": "EndgameZero",
    "Yo, how's it going? My name is EndgameZero.": "哟，最近咋样？我是EndgameZero。",
    "I'm here because of my work on Hearth's Neighbor.": "我是因为参与了《Hearth's Neighbor》的制作才来的。",
    "Did you know that there's an unofficial Outer Wilds modding discord? I go by \"EndgameZero\" over there.": "你知道有个非官方的《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord社群吗？我在那儿的ID是“EndgameZero”。",

    //GameWyrm.xml
    "GameWyrm": "GameWyrm",
    "Hi! I'm GameWyrm! I'm primarily known for my work on Hearth's Neighbor, and its sequel, Magistarium! ": "嗨！我是GameWyrm！我最出名的作品是《Hearth's Neighbor》及其续作《Hearth's Neighbor 2: Magistarium》！",
    "I'm also involved in the Archipelago Randomizer implementation for Outer Wilds! I also created Outer Relics, and worked with xen on a puzzle mod called \"Escape Room\"!": "我还参与了《星际拓荒》的《Archipelago》随机化模组的制作！我还做了《Outer Relics》，并和xen一起做了一个解谜模组叫《Outer Wilds Escape Room》！",
    "I'm also working on a new mod called Halcyon Nexus Zero, so keep a look out for that!": "我还在做一个新模组叫《Halcyon Nexus Zero》，记得关注哦！",
    "Anyway, glad to see you here in the community mod jam! If you went here as one of the first places you visited, well, good choice! I bet we'll see each other again soon...": "不管怎样，很高兴在这个社群创作赛见到你！如果你把这里当作第一个访问的地方，那可真选对了！我打赌我们很快会再见面的……",

    //Hawkbar.xml
    "Hawkbar": "Hawkbar",
    "Oh, hey! Pleasure to meet you, I'm Hawkbar.": "哦，嘿！很高兴认识你，我是Hawkbar。",
    "I was invited because of my involvement in New Horizons and Arcanum Adrift.": "我因为参与了《New Horizons》和《Arcanum Adrift》的制作才受邀来的。",
    "Be sure to look out for Wrong Warp, which is a mod that I'm currently working on!": "记得关注《Wrong Warp》，这是我正在制作的模组！",
    "You can find me on the Outer Wilds modding discord as \"Hawkbar\"!": "你可以在《星际拓荒》模组创作Discord上找到我，ID是“Hawkbar”！",

    //Etherpod.xml
    "Etherpod": "Etherpod",
    "Hey! I'm Etherpod.": "嘿！我是Etherpod。",
    "What? I'm not a flower.": "什么？我不是花。",
    "I'm not a flower! Go bother someone else with your outlandish accusations!": "我才不是花！别用你这些离谱的指控来烦我！",
    "I'm a biped, just like you.": "我是双足生物，和你一样。",
    "I would prove it to you, but my current situation makes that a bit... difficult.": "我本想证明给你看，但我现在的处境有点……不方便。",
    "Why don't you go chat with some of the other modders here? I'm sure they wouldn't mind someone to talk to.": "你不如去和这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊？我相信他们不会介意有人搭话的。",
    "What... do you mean by that? Actually- nevermind, forget I asked.": "你……你这话是什么意思？算了，当我没问。",
    "Go talk to someone else. There's plenty of options to choose from!": "去跟别人聊吧，这儿有的是人可以选！",
    "Story mods? Let me think... I would say Eyes of the Past, but I'm sure you know about that one already if you're talking to me.": "故事类模组？让我想想……我会推荐《Eyes of the Past》，不过既然你在跟我聊天，想必已经知道这个模组了。",
    "Forgotten Castaways is a pretty good one. I really love the idea of Dark Bramble, and I think it captures the feeling of it without being super scary. Definitely one of my favorites.": "《Forgotten Castaways》挺不错的。我超喜欢黑棘星的设定，这个模组完美还原了那种氛围，又不会太吓人。绝对是我最爱的模组之一。",
    "More? Sure. Hmm...": "还要更多推荐？行啊。嗯……",
    "Have you played Heliostudy? It's one of the entries to the fifth modding jam, and it's another one of my favorites.": "你玩过《Heliostudy》吗？那是第五届模组创作赛的参赛作品，也是我超爱的一款。",
    "Uh... sure.": "呃……当然。",
    "Fret's Quest is pretty cool. You could check that one out.": "《Fret's Quest》挺酷的，你可以试试。",
    "Maybe try Astral Codec. I heard that one is pretty popular.": "或许可以试试《Astral Codec》，我听说那款挺火的。",
    "The Outsider is pretty cool, I think it's one of the first mods I played.": "《The Outsider》也很棒，那是我玩的第一批模组之一。",
    "Hearth's Neighbor: Magistarium is a good one, you could try that.": "《Hearth's Neighbor 2: Magistarium》也不错，值得一试。",
    "Dreambound is a cool one, it was from the fourth jam.": "《Dreambound》挺有意思的，是第四届创作赛的作品。",
    "More?? Okay, sure.": "还要更多？行吧。",
    "I liked Christmas Story. That's a fun one.": "我喜欢《Christmas Story》，那款玩着很有意思。",
    "Evacuation is cool, you could try that.": "《Evacuation》也很棒，你可以看看。",
    "Band Together is fun, but I'm a little biased having worked on it myself.": "《Band Together》挺好玩的，不过我自己参与了制作，可能有点偏心啦。",
    "The Cosmic Curators is another good one. I really liked it.": "《The Cosmic Curators》也很不错，我特别喜欢。",
    "The Stranger They Are is cool, and it's super long as well.": "《The Stranger They Are》挺棒的，而且篇幅还超长。",
    "I think that's quite enough for you, actually.": "其实这些对你来说应该够多了。",
    "How about you go talk to some of the others? Doesn't that sound like a great idea? It sure does!": "不如你去跟其他人聊聊？这主意不错吧？当然不错啦！",
    "Anytime!": "随时乐意！",
    "Alright, cool.": "好嘞。",
    "I'm just gonna... leave you alone.": "我还是……不打扰你了。",
    "Oh, cool. I guess I don't need to talk about the mods I've worked on.": "哦，好吧。看来我没必要介绍自己参与的模组了。",
    "See you around! Make sure you talk to all the modders!": "回头见！记得跟所有模组创作者都聊聊呀！",
    "I would hope so. You were just talking to me.": "那当然啦，你刚才还在跟我聊天呢。",
    "I've helped create a decent number of mods, but you might know me for my work on Band Together, Ship Enhancements, and Traveler's Pack.": "我参与制作过不少模组，不过你可能是通过《Band Together》《Ship Enhancements》和《Traveler's Pack》认识我的。",
    "Cool! You probably have a general idea of what I've worked on, then.": "太好了！这么说你大概知道我做过什么了。",
    "That's enough from me, though. Go have a chat with the other modders here! They probably have interesting stuff to share, too.": "不过我就说这么多啦。去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧！他们肯定也有不少有意思的事要分享。",
    "Hmm... What about Eyes of the Past? Does that sound familiar? I created most of the terrain for that mod.": "嗯……《Eyes of the Past》呢？听起来耳熟吗？那个模组的大部分地形都是我做的。",
    "Well, it was worth a shot. You should go play those mods! They're super cool.": "好吧，试了总比没试强。你真该玩玩这些模组！都超棒的。",
    "Alright, go have a chat with the other modders in this building. Maybe you'll recognize some of them!": "好啦，去跟这栋建筑里的其他模组创作者聊聊吧，说不定能认出几个熟面孔呢！",
    "It's an awesome mod! Everyone on the team has done such a good job making it. Even the original Outer Wilds developers know about the mod!": "这模组超赞的！团队里每个人都做得超棒。就连《星际拓荒》的原版开发者都知道这个模组呢！",
    "That's enough rambling from me, though. Go chat with some other modders here, I'm sure they have some interesting stories to share!": "不过我也絮叨够了。去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧，他们肯定有不少有意思的故事！",
    "Are we? I can't see anything.": "我们是吗？我什么都看不见啊。",
    "What? A flower? That's a silly thing to say.": "什么？花？你这话说得也太离谱了。",
    "Anyway, go have a chat with some of the other modders here. And maybe don't say they look like vegetation.": "不管怎样，去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧。还有，别再说人家长得像植物了。",
    "Oh, cool. Hey, is pikpik_carrot around here somewhere?": "哦，对了。嘿，pikpik_carrot是不是也在这儿啊？",
    "He's the lead developer of Eyes of the Past. He should be around here somewhere.": "他是《Eyes of the Past》的首席开发者，应该就在这附近。",
    "If you find him, can you ask him to let me out of his basement?": "如果你见到他，能不能帮我问问他，能不能把我从他的地下室里放出来？",
    "Thanks a lot. Safe travels!": "太谢谢你了。祝你一路平安！",
    "Well, it was worth a shot. I would go ask him myself, but being locked in a basement kind of makes that difficult.": "好吧，试了总比没试强。我本来想自己去问的，但被锁在地下室里，实在没办法。",
    "I'll stop talking, now. Go have a chat with some of the other modders here!": "我不说了。去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧！",
    "Oh.": "哦。",
    "Can you ask him to let me out of his basement?": "你能帮我问问他，把我从地下室放出来吗？",
    "What? You were just talking to me!": "什么？你刚才还在跟我聊天呢！",
    "Well, I guess I'm just forgettable, then. It's not your fault.": "好吧，看来我就是个容易被忘记的人。这也不是你的错。",
    "You do? Nice to know I wasn't completely forgotten.": "你还记得我？太好了，看来我还没被彻底遗忘。",
    "I guess you won't be needing a recap on who I am, then. Have fun exploring!": "这么说你应该不用我再介绍自己了吧。祝你探索愉快！",
    "You're joking, right?": "你在开玩笑吧？",
    "Oh, man, I'm sorry. I didn't know.": "哦，天呐，对不起，我不知道。",
    "Let me know if there's anything I can do to help.": "如果有什么我能帮上忙的，随时告诉我。",
    "You tell me.": "你倒说说看。",
    "Hmm...": "嗯……",
    "Fine. I believe you.": "行吧，我信你。",
    "But I want you to prove it. If you can't lie, tell me something that only I would know.": "但你得证明给我看。如果你不会撒谎，那就说一件只有我才知道的事。",
    "...does that include what you just said?": "……你刚才说的这话也算吗？",
    "Maybe? What does that even mean? How can you lie about that?": "也许吧？这到底是什么意思啊？这种事怎么撒谎？",
    "Whatever, it's not important. Go talk to some of the other modders here!": "算了，不重要。去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧！",
    "Yes? But actually no?": "是？又不是？",
    "This whole lying business is really confusing.": "这撒谎的事儿也太绕了。",
    "Anyway, you should go talk to some other modders here now. I'll see you around!": "不管怎样，你现在去跟其他模组创作者聊聊吧。回头见！",
    "What? Why? Hey, where are you going?": "什么？为什么啊？嘿，你要去哪儿？",
    "Why are you still here?": "你怎么还在这儿？",
    "What? But you just said-": "什么？可你刚才明明说——",
    "Are you still doing that \"I only speak in lies\" thing?": "你还在玩那个“我只说谎言”的梗吗？",
    "Oh. You're not?": "哦。你不玩了？",
    "Tell me something that's true, then.": "那说件真事来听听。",
    "What? No I'm not! You're lying!": "什么？我才没有！你在撒谎！",
    "Go lie to someone else, I don't want to hear any more of this.": "去跟别人撒谎吧，我不想再听这些了。",
    "We are? Surely not. It's impossible. Everything here looks pretty real to me.": "我们是吗？不可能吧。这儿的一切在我看来都挺真实的啊。",
    "Unless... it isn't? Think about it. An enormous house, stationed on an uninhabited planet. Why is this planet here? Or this house? It makes no sense. And all of these people, gathered together in this house. But for what? Why are we here? I don't know why. And how did we get here? Was it by ship? By warp? I... I don't remember. I don't remember anything. My past. It's dark. Blank. Empty. I don't remember my past. I have no past, I just came into existence. Why? What is my purpose? Is this even life? Trapped here, forced to serve a stranger? Forced by who? Am I even being forced? Maybe I never had a choice to begin with. Maybe there's nothing else besides this life. Maybe this is my purpose. To sit here, idly waiting for someone to walk by and strike up conversation with me. Is there any escape from this purgatory? Any at all? Can I end this madness? Please... free me from this prison. I don't know who I am I don't know why I'm here... I just want to live... to be someone...": "除非……这一切都不是真的？你想想看。一栋巨大的房子，建在一颗无人星球上。这颗星球为什么会在这儿？这房子又是为什么存在？根本说不通啊。还有这么多人，聚集在这房子里。到底是为了什么？我们为什么会在这儿？我不知道。我也不知道自己是怎么来的？是坐船？还是跃迁？我……我什么都不记得了。我的过去，一片漆黑，一片空白，一无所有。我不记得自己的过去，我根本没有过去，我就这么突然存在了。为什么？我的使命是什么？这就算是活着吗？被困在这里，被迫为一个陌生人服务？被谁强迫？我真的是被强迫的吗？也许我从一开始就别无选择。也许除了这样的生活，再无其他可能。也许这就是我的使命——坐在这儿，无所事事地等着有人路过，跟我搭句话。这炼狱般的处境，还有逃离的可能吗？哪怕一丝一毫？我能结束这疯狂的一切吗？求你了……把我从这牢笼里救出去吧。我不知道自己是谁，不知道为什么会在这里……我只想好好活着……想成为一个真正的自己……",
    "Uh... you okay?": "呃……你还好吗？",
    "Hey, that wasn't a lie!": "嘿，刚才那番话可不是谎言！",
    "Does it have to be?": "非得是谎言吗？",
    "Well, I mean- I thought- You said that-": "我是说——我以为——你之前说——",
    "You know what? This is too much to think about. Go talk to some other modders.": "算了，这事儿太费脑子了。去跟其他模组创作者聊聊吧。",
    "That... uh...": "那……呃……",
    "You know what, how about you go talk to some other modders? I'm sure they'd appreciate the attention.": "要不这样，你去跟其他模组创作者聊聊？他们肯定会很乐意有人关注的。",
    "Alright, have fun out there!": "好啦，祝你玩得开心！",
    "Okay, this is the second time you've done this. What's going on?": "好吧，这都是你第二次这么做了。到底怎么回事？",
    "Oh, cool. I guess it would be fine if I just... stopped talking to you, then.": "哦，行吧。那我……不跟你聊了也行。",
    "YES. YES. YES.": "好！好！好！",
    "Alright, bye! Make sure you go talk to the other modders here!": "好啦，再见！记得去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊！",
    "Uh... weird thing to say, but okay.": "呃……这话有点奇怪，不过行吧。",
    "Hey, wait- where are you going?": "嘿，等等——你要去哪儿？",
    "That was a lie, wasn't it? Which means you lied about always lying...": "刚才那是谎言，对吧？也就是说，你说自己“只说谎言”这话本身就是谎言……",
    "Ah. I'll uh... try not to think about the implications of that.": "啊。我……尽量不去想这背后的逻辑吧。",
    "Anyway, why don't you go talk to some other modders? I'm sure they have some interesting stuff to say.": "不管怎样，你去跟其他模组创作者聊聊吧，他们肯定有不少有意思的事要说。",
    "Oh, dear. You've gotten yourself trapped in a paradox, haven't you?": "哦，天哪。你这是陷入悖论里出不来了，是吧？",
    "If I had to guess what caused it, it would probably be what you said about always lying... and how that was a lie itself.": "要我说，罪魁祸首就是你那句“只说谎言”……而且这话本身就是个谎言。",
    "I'm sure it'll sort itself out eventually. The pain and distorted perception of reality is only temporary, I think.": "我相信最后总会自行解决的。那种痛苦和对现实的扭曲认知，应该只是暂时的吧。",
    "There, see? it's over already.": "你看，这不是没事了嘛。",
    "Now go chat with some of the other modders here. Everyone has their own stories to share!": "现在去跟这儿的其他模组创作者聊聊吧。每个人都有自己的故事要分享呢！",
    "...is that my IP address? How did you-": "……这不是我的IP地址吗？你怎么——",
    "Whatever. It doesn't matter. You've clearly proven you're incapable of lying.": "算了，不重要了。你显然已经证明自己不会撒谎了。",
    "Wha- Be quiet! Someone might hear you!": "什——小声点！万一被别人听到了！",
    "Okay, I think it's safe.": "好啦，应该安全了。",
    "Look, after that whole \"Order of the Shrubbery\" thing, the Sacred Shrubbery has become real unpopular, so let's just... keep quiet about that.": "你看，自从“灌木教团”那事儿之后，神圣灌木就变得特别不受欢迎了，所以这事儿……咱们还是保密吧。",
    "But yes, you're right. I do secretly worship the Sacred Shrubbery, but I've never told anyone.": "不过你说得对，我确实偷偷崇拜神圣灌木，但我从来没跟别人说过。",
    "The fact you knew that makes it pretty clear that you're blessed with Eternal Truth. I was wrong to ever doubt you.": "你居然知道这件事，显然你是被“永恒真理”眷顾的人。我之前怀疑你，真是大错特错。",
    "...does this mean you really forgot about me, though?": "……不过这是不是意味着，你真的把我忘了？",
    "Well, that's a shame. I can go over my introduction again, if you'd like.": "唉，真可惜。如果你想的话，我可以再自我介绍一遍。",
    "That's alright. Now go talk to some other modders, I'm sure they have some interesting things to say!": "没关系。现在去跟其他模组创作者聊聊吧，他们肯定有不少有意思的事要说！",
    "That's nice to hear. It'd be a shame to be forgotten.": "能听到你这么说真开心。被人遗忘可太惨了。",
    "I'll tell you what you have forgotten, though. Look at all the other modders here! I'm sure they could all use a conversation right about now.": "不过我得提醒你，你忘了一件事。你看看这儿的其他模组创作者！他们现在肯定都很想有人跟他们聊聊天。",
    "Safe travels, and happy chatting!": "祝你旅途平安，聊天愉快！",
    "Wow, rude. I was going to offer to introduce myself again, but not when you're acting like that.": "哇，真没礼貌。我本来还想再自我介绍一遍的，不过你这态度，算了吧。",
    "WHAT?!? That's it. Get out of my sight.": "什么？！？够了。滚出我的视线。",
    "If you say so. Kind of a mean thing to joke about, if you ask me.": "既然你这么说，那就算了。不过要我说，这种玩笑开得有点过分了。",
    "What do you mean nonsense?! You're the one who isn't making any sense!": "你说什么胡话呢？明明是你在胡说八道！",
    "I know you!": "我认识你！",
    "Since when could flowers talk?": "花什么时候会说话了？",
    "What story mods would you recommend I play?": "你推荐我玩哪些故事类模组？",
    "I beg to differ.": "我不敢苟同。",
    "Then what are you?": "那你是什么？",
    "Likely story.": "说得跟真的似的。",
    "Oh, cool! What flavor?": "哦，酷！什么口味的？",
    "Can I get more recommendations?": "能再给我推荐几个吗？",
    "Thanks.": "谢谢。",
    "More.": "再来点。",
    "More. Recommendations.": "更多。推荐。",
    "That'll do.": "够了。",
    "Not enough.": "不够。",
    "I'm not running errands for you.": "我才不给你跑腿呢。",
    "I forgot!": "我忘了！",
    "Oh, right. I remember you.": "哦，对了，我记得你。",
    "No, I really do have short term memory loss, and can't remember ever talking to you.": "不，我真的有短期失忆症，不记得曾经跟你聊过天。",
    "Would I ever lie to you?": "我怎么会骗你呢？",
    "I would never lie to you.": "我绝对不会骗你。",
    "Everything I say is a lie.": "我说的每一句话都是谎言。",
    "199.34.228.77": "199.34.228.77",
    "You worship the Sacred Shrubbery in secret.": "你偷偷崇拜神圣灌木。",
    "Yes.": "是。",
    "No.": "不是。",
    "Maybe.": "可能吧。",
    "Sure, I'll leave you alone.": "行，我不打扰你了。",
    "I'll stay here, actually.": "其实我想留在这儿。",
    "I never said I would leave you alone.": "我从没说过要离开你。",
    "Oh, sorry. I'm leaving right now.": "哦，对不起。我现在就走。",
    "I want to stay here with you forever.": "我想永远跟你待在一起。",
    "What? No.": "什么？不是。",
    "You're a flower.": "你是一朵花。",
    "We're inside a simulation.": "我们在一个模拟空间里。",
    "I'm gonna go...": "我走了……",
    "What kind of question is that? It's four.": "这是什么问题啊？答案是四。",
    "I wouldn't give an answer, because that's a dumb question.": "我才不回答呢，这问题太傻了。",
    "Don't worry, I can stop lying whenever I want. I do not need help. I am perfectly fine.": "别担心，我想不撒谎就能不撒谎。我不需要帮忙，我好得很。",
    "Ä̵̡̬̫̱͖̭́̆͐͘Ą̸͇̯͕̺͚̤̼̘̞̲̙̰͑̿̋͜À̶͚͓̹͍Ą̷̛̜̤̫̪̺̯͈̙̤̞͓͎̽̽́̄̇̈́̀̉Ḁ̵͓̄̉͐́͐̽̂̍́̈́̃͆̚͘͠Å̶͕̗̗͓̰͙̙̠̳̪͈̇͆͜ͅͅÂ̷̩͎̙̤̱͖̝͓̾͒͌̈́̎̔̑̏̚͘͜ͅȀ̶̧̛̪̳͎͔͍͍͍̳̥̦͕͚͌̑̿͛̓̅͑̂̓͛̔͜͠A̶͚͆́͌̂̊̀̇̊Ą̸͇̭̗̙̜̙̞̭͖͔̜̯̩̊͐̆͜͠͝Ä̸̝̫͙̦̱̖̬́͑̒A̴̧̺͚̯̳̅̒̀́̈́̀͐͛͊̆̇̚͝A̴̝̘͕͙̦͋̊̓̇̂̈́̉̎͌̀̎̄̓̋̚": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊",
