    "<i>*cough*</i>": "<i>*咳嗽*</i>",
    "<i>*cough cough*</i>": "<i>*咳嗽 咳嗽*</i>",
    "<i>*initiate a staring contest*</i>": "<i>*开始对视比赛*</i>",
    "So... nice weather today, huh?": "所以……今天天气不错，是吧？",
    "This planet doesn't even get weather!": "这颗星球根本就没有天气可言！",
    "Seriously? That's all you could think of to say?": "不是吧？你就只能想到说这个？",
    "Well how was I supposed to know that? I'm sitting around inside all the time!": "那我哪知道啊？我一直都待在里面啊！",
    "Fair enough.": "说得也是。",
    "Have you tried, I don't know- going outside?": "你有没有试过……比如说，出去走走？",
    "How about you go talk to some other modders here? I'm sure they get up and run around all the time.": "你不如去跟这里其他模组作者聊聊？他们肯定经常到处走动。",
    "My current situation makes that... difficult.": "我现在的状况……让我很难做到。",
    "Go chat with some of the other modders here! I'm sure they'd like someone to talk to.": "去跟这里其他模组作者聊聊天吧！他们肯定很想找人说话。",
    "It's not like you had any better ideas. Otherwise you would have said them already.": "你也没什么更好的主意，不然你早就说了。",
    "How about instead of arguing with me, you go talk to some other modders in the building! I'm sure they're feeling very lonely.": "别跟我吵了，去跟楼里其他模组作者聊聊吧！他们肯定很孤单。",
    "...why are you staring at me like that?": "……你为什么这么盯着我？",
