    "<i>*blink*</i>": "<i>*眨眼*</i>",
    "HA! I won!": "哈！我赢了！",
    "Fine. Congratulations.": "行吧，恭喜你。",
    "Now go find some other modders to talk to!": "现在去找其他模组作者聊聊吧！",
    "Forefit what? Hey, where are you going?": "认什么输？喂，你要去哪儿？",
    "Alright, I'm not falling for it this time. I know you haven't forgotten who I am.": "好吧，这次我可不上当了。我知道你没忘记我是谁。",
    "It was worth a shot.": "试试总没错。",
    "No, really. I have no idea who you are.": "不，真的。我完全不知道你是谁。",
    "Maybe you'll have better luck with some of the other modders here.": "也许你跟这里其他模组作者交流会更顺利。",
    "Likely story. Why don't you go talk to one of the other countless modders in this building?": "鬼才信。你怎么不去跟这楼里其他无数个模组作者聊聊？",
    "Hey. Do you remember me?": "嘿。你还记得我吗？",
