    "What? I thought you had that condition thing. You kept forgetting who I was.": "什么？我还以为你有那个毛病，老是忘了我是谁。",
    "Oh, yeah. I still have that. I just chose to remember you this time.": "哦，对。我还有那毛病。只是这次我选择记住你。",
