    "I can prove it to you. First, I greeted you, and then you said something, and then...": "我可以证明给你看。首先，我跟你打了招呼，然后你说了些话，接着……",
    "Don't worry. Soon, your whole world will slip away from your memory. You don't have long.": "别担心。很快，你的整个世界都会从记忆里消失。你时间不多了。",
    "It... that doesn't...": "这……这不对……",
